推免考核题目学生版.pdf

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# Node / Vite (frontend)
node_modules/
web/frontend/dist/

# Compiled / agent-generated artifacts in the demo workspace
*.class

# Demo workspace: only the two seed files are tracked; everything the agent
